---
import '@fontsource/rajdhani/500.css';
import '@fontsource/rajdhani/700.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/400.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/600.css';
import '@fontsource/share-tech-mono';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/visual.css';
import '../styles/explorer.css';
import '../styles/refinement.css';
import '../styles/optics.css';
import OpticalShell from '../components/OpticalShell.astro';
import {site,sections,url,brand} from '../config';
import Discord from '../components/Discord.astro';
interface Props { title?:string; description?:string; active?:string; noindex?:boolean; }
const {title=brand.primary,description=site.description,active='',noindex=false}=Astro.props;
const canonical=new URL(Astro.url.pathname,Astro.site);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#071525"/><title>{title} | KiroshiRP</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>{noindex && <meta name="robots" content="noindex"/>}<meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content={`${title} | KiroshiRP`}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:image" content={new URL(url('images/kiroshi-original.jpg'),Astro.site)}/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><link rel="icon" href={url('favicon.svg')}/></head>
<body class:list={{'optic-home':active==='inicio'}}><OpticalShell home={active==='inicio'}/><a class="skip" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a><header class="site-header"><a class="wordmark" href={url()} aria-label="KiroshiRP, inicio"><span class="eye" aria-hidden="true">◉</span><span>KIROSHI<small>ROLEPLAY</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navigation">MENÚ ☰</button><nav id="navigation" aria-label="Principal"><a href={url('guias/')} aria-current={active==='guias'?'page':undefined}>Empieza aquí</a><details class="nav-group"><summary class:list={{selected:['lore','facciones','explorar'].includes(active)}}>El mundo <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="nav-dropdown"><a href={url('explorar/')} aria-current={active==='explorar'?'page':undefined}>Explorar Night City</a><a href={url('lore/')} aria-current={active==='lore'?'page':undefined}>Lore</a><a href={url('facciones/')} aria-current={active==='facciones'?'page':undefined}>Facciones</a></div></details><details class="nav-group"><summary class:list={{selected:['mecanicas','normativas'].includes(active)}}>Cómo jugar <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="nav-dropdown"><a href={url('mecanicas/')} aria-current={active==='mecanicas'?'page':undefined}>Mecánicas</a><a href={url('normativas/')} aria-current={active==='normativas'?'page':undefined}>Normativas</a></div></details><a href={url('actualizaciones/')} aria-current={active==='actualizaciones'?'page':undefined}>Novedades</a><Discord/></nav><a class="search-toggle" href={url('buscar/')} aria-label="Buscar en el archivo"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span> Buscar</a></header>
<main id="contenido"><slot/></main>
<footer><div class="footer-top"><a class="wordmark" href={url()}>KIROSHIRP<small>{brand.primary}</small></a><span class="mono">{brand.secondary}</span></div><div class="footer-links"><a href={url()}>Inicio</a><a href={url('explorar/')}>Explorar Night City</a>{sections.map(s=><a href={url(`${s.id}/`)}>{s.title}</a>)}<a href={site.discord || url('contacto/')}>Discord</a><a href={url('contacto/')}>Contacto</a><a href={url('aviso-legal/')}>Aviso legal</a><a href={url('privacidad/')}>Política de privacidad</a></div><p>KiroshiRP es un proyecto independiente de la comunidad, ambientado en el universo de Cyberpunk 2077. No está afiliado oficialmente a CD PROJEKT RED ni a OPEN//77.</p><p class="fine">Cyberpunk 2077 y sus elementos pertenecen a sus respectivos titulares. Imagen de marca facilitada por KiroshiRP. Archivo público · Sin cuentas de usuario.</p></footer>
<script>
 const toggle=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.menu-toggle'); const nav=document.querySelector('#navigation');
 toggle?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));nav?.classList.toggle('open',open)});
 const groups=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('.nav-group')];
 groups.forEach(group=>group.addEventListener('toggle',()=>{if(group.open)groups.forEach(other=>{if(other!==group)other.open=false;});}));
 document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target instanceof Node&&!nav?.contains(e.target))groups.forEach(g=>g.open=false);});
 document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){const focused=groups.find(g=>g.open&&g.contains(document.activeElement));groups.forEach(g=>g.open=false);if(focused){focused.querySelector('summary')?.focus();}else if(toggle?.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'){toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');nav?.classList.remove('open');toggle.focus();}}});
 window.addEventListener('scroll',()=>document.querySelector('.site-header')?.classList.toggle('scrolled',window.scrollY>30),{passive:true});
</script></body></html>
